# Any log, anywhere. The specific rules above were not enough: six files named after port numbers
# (5270.log and friends) were committed by a `git add -A`, written by a shell loop whose arguments
# failed to expand. Service logs belong in /tmp, and a log that reaches the repository root is
# always an accident.
*.log

